00:58:20.770 --> 00:58:26.070
<v Zora Bikangaga>(AFRICAN ACCENT) Yeah, I've seen House Party. You know, this is one of my favorite movies.
<v Zora Bikangaga>（非洲口音）是啊，我看过《House Party》。你知道，这是我最喜欢的电影之一。

00:58:26.070 --> 00:58:31.070
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是Ira Glass。下周将带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
